# Mass spectrometry data: never commit acquisitions by accident. Patterns match at any depth;
# a plain ".mzML" would only match a file with exactly that name. The small authored fixtures
# are re-included below (Git ignores new files there unless they match a "!" rule).
*.mzML
*.mzml
*.mzML.gz
*.mzml.gz
*.mzXML
*.mzxml
*.raw
*.RAW
*.wiff
*.wiff2
*.wiff.scan
# Vendor "directory" data (Agilent .d, Waters .raw, Bruker .d)
*.d/
!test_file/*.mzML
!tests/fixtures/**/*.mzML

!docs/MCP_ANALYSIS.md
!docs/FEATURE_STATUS.md
!docs/ENGINE_OPERATIONS.md
!docs/RELEASE_NOTES.md
